flowchart TD
    A[GPS fix / speed estimate] --> B[Predict state]
    C[Heading + motion estimate] --> B
    D[Previous East/North state] --> B

    B --> E[Sigma points]
    E --> F[State covariance update]
    F --> G{GPS usable?}

    G -->|Yes| H[Measurement update]
    G -->|No| I[Propagate without correction]

    H --> J[Corrected E/N position]
    I --> J
    J --> K[Output DR track]
    K --> L[FIT logging + UI]
